"    :target: https://github.com/OCA/l10n-france/tree/20.0/l10n_fr_siret\n"
"    :alt: OCA/l10n-france\n"
".. |badge4| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/weblate-Translate%20me-F47D42.png\n"
