"    :alt: Translate me on Weblate\n"
".. |badge5| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/runboat-Try%20me-875A7B.png\n"
"    :target: https://runboat.odoo-community.org/builds?repo=OCA/l10n-france&target_branch=20.0\n"
"    :alt: Try me on Runboat\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3| |badge4| |badge5|\n"
"\n"
"Since v20.0 of Odoo Community, the ``base`` module from the official\n"
"addons already handles the SIREN and SIRET. If you only need to stores\n"
"SIREN and SIRET, you do not need anymore ``l10n_fr_siret``.\n"
"\n"
"What the native official addons handle (new in v20.0):\n"
"\n"
"- the validity of the VAT, SIREN and SIRET independently with each other\n"
"  by verifying their checksum,\n"
"- updating the SIREN from the SIRET (only when the SIREN is empty).\n"
"\n"
"What **l10n_fr_siret** brings for French partners:\n"
"\n"
"- it checks the consistence between the VAT number and SIREN,\n"
"- it checks the consistence between the SIREN and SIRET,\n"
"- it detects duplicates between partner having the same SIREN and adds a\n"
"  warning banner on the partner form view to warn it. This is similar\n"
"  than native VAT duplicate warning. Actually, the SIREN warning will be\n"
"  hidden if the VAT warning is already displaid.\n"
"\n"
"Note: ``l10n_fr_siret`` now depends of ``l10n_fr_account``. Indeed, the\n"
"widget ``x2many_buttons`` we used to list duplicates partners is\n"
"declared on ``account``.\n"
"\n"
"|image|\n"
"\n"
".. |image| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OCA/l10n-france/20.0/l10n_fr_siret/static/description/partner_duplicate_warning.png\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"The last digits of the SIREN and NIC are control keys: Odoo will already\n"
"check their validity.\n"
"\n"
"The warning banner is displayed on the partner form view if another\n"
"partner:\n"
"\n"
"- has the same SIREN,\n"
"- has not already the same VAT,\n"
"- if the partner is attached to a specific company: is in the same\n"
"  company or is not attached to a specific company,\n"
"- if the partner is not attached to a specific company: is in any\n"
"  company or not attached to a specific company.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-france/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/OCA/l10n-france/issues/new?body=module:%20l10n_fr_siret%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
